": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "根据提供的检索资料，关于 WMS 事件、重复数据去重以及 `event_id`/幂等性的处理逻辑，主要依据《28_原表审计_source_audit.xlsx》中的业务规则审查报告（SRC002）以及《15_WMS出入库_wms_transactions（抽样版）.xlsx》中的字段定义。\n\n以下是具体的处理建议：\n\n### 1. 核心关联键与去重策略\n在 WMS 及订单异常处理中，**严禁仅通过“合同编号”进行 JOIN 或去重操作**。\n*   **原因**：审计发现合同表中特定合同编号存在重复且对应不同订单的情况 <kb doc=\"28_原表审计_source_audit.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"0d759d1d-1618-4af1-9f13-ab0c9d8b0e88\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n*   **正确做法**：必须使用 **订单号 (`sales_order_id`)** 或 **工单号 (`work_order_id`)** 作为唯一的业务关联键，以确保数据匹配的精确性 <kb doc=\"28_原表审计_source_audit.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"0d759d1d-1618-4af1-9f13-ab0c9d8b0e88\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n\n### 2. WMS 交易记录的幂等性与唯一标识\n对于 WMS 出入库流水（`wms_transactions`），实现幂等性和去重的关键在于识别主键和来源记录：\n*   **主键标识**：每条仓库移动事务都有一个唯一的 **`transaction_id`**（例如以 \"WMS\" 开头的字符串）。该字段被明确定义为用于“精确跟踪、审计和库存移动的**去重**”的主键 <kb doc=\"15_WMS出入库_wms_transactions（抽样版）.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"b862e201-774a-40be-b772-a1d13ab57845\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n*   **外部引用**：`reference_id` 字段用于链接源文档（如采购订单 PO-、发货单 SH- 等），辅助跨系统对账和争议解决，但不能替代 `transaction_id` 作为内部去重依据 <kb doc=\"15_WMS出入库_wms_transactions（抽样版）.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"b862e201-774a-40be-b772-a1d13ab57845\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n\n### 3. 异常事件（Exception）的去重与状态管理\n在处理异常事件（如延期、投诉、节点超时）时，需注意以下数据特征以避免逻辑错误：\n*   **复合事件标记**：部分异常是“复合事件”（如“延期+投诉”），在统计或去重时需区分单一事件与复合事件，避免将同一根本原因导致的多个表现误判为独立重复事件 <kb doc=\"订单数据-异常处理流程自动化.md\" chunk_id=\"cb80ddc7-46e4-4ff7-920c-7fe5bfd2139b\" kb_id=\"f9730005-3478-4100-8845-d10f762b565e\" />。\n*   **状态流转**：异常记录包含 `status`（处理中、已关闭、待回访）和 `opened_at`/`closed_at` 时间戳。去重时应保留最新状态或最终闭环记录，而非简单删除所有相似条目 <kb doc=\"24_异常事件_exceptions（抽样版）.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"b74c24d2-bfb0-4acf-a87a-960338ad0b07\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n*   **无效数据过滤**：若下单时间晚于固定基准时点（未来订单），应标记为无效（`is_effective=0`）并排除其生产或仓储流水，这类数据不应参与正常的去重统计 <kb doc=\"28_原表审计_source_audit.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"0d759d1d-1618-4af1-9f13-ab0c9d8b0e88\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />。\n\n### 总结建议\n1.  **去重键选择**：优先使用 `transaction_id`（WMS流水）或 `exception_id` + `sales_order_id`（异常事件）。\n2.  **禁止项**：不要使用 `contract_no`（合同编号）作为去重或关联的唯一依据。\n3.  **幂等实现**：在写入 WMS 数据时，检查 `transaction_id` 是否已存在；若存在则跳过或更新状态，确保同一笔物理移动只记录一次。", "id": "c2927a7750c741f6bad381acedc87035", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:01.701295", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:01.703054", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The user asks a factual/behavioral question about the collection pipeline: what happens if the same WMS event is received repeatedly? I should verify empirically by looking at collect.py and running it (idempotent). Let me inspect the script and the raw samples, then demonstrate by running collect.py twice and comparing outputs.\n\nLet me read the collect.py script.", "id": "e661e812251f4867b43f6ba000ed2146", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:03.760852", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_964b129fad5541118aa3b7b8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && ls -R datahub | head -60 && echo \\\"=====\\\" && wc -l datahub/scripts/collect.py\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:05.323198", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_7ce6630458af4fcd93b768bc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && sed -n '1,200p' datahub/scripts/collect.py\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:06.696801", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_964b129fad5541118aa3b7b8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "datahub:\nagent_data.sqlite\ndocs\noutput\nraw\nscripts\n\ndatahub/docs:\nschema.json\n业务口径要点.md\n字段字典.csv\n查询入门.sql\n\ndatahub/output:\n_risk_raw.json\n_tmp_calib.sql\n_tmp_calib1.sql\n_tmp_calib2.sql\n_tmp_calib2b.sql\n_tmp_final.sql\n_tmp_intransit.sql\n_tmp_residual.sql\n_tmp_residual2.sql\n_tmp_unshipped.sql\n_tmp_x.sql\ndaily_brief_2026-09-17.md\ndelivered_orders.csv\ndelivered_orders.sql\ndelivered_orders_20260918.csv\n\ndatahub/raw:\nerp\nevent_stream.jsonl\nevent_stream_retry.jsonl\nexcel\ningestion_bad_cases.jsonl\nmes\noa\nwechat\nwms\n\ndatahub/raw/erp:\nstages.json\nwork_orders.json\n\ndatahub/raw/excel:\n生产工时原始台账.csv\n金汉隆销售订单数据模型_202512-202609_扩量精修版.xlsx\n\ndatahub/raw/mes:\nequipment_logs.jsonl\n\ndatahub/raw/oa:\nforms.json\n\ndatahub/raw/wechat:\nCHAT_001.png\nCHAT_002.png\nCHAT_003.png\nCHAT_004.png\n=====\n187 datahub/scripts/collect.py", "id": "4adafb01e27e4831b1f56ac2bd85de85", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:07.721962", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:25:07.723936", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_7ce6630458af4fcd93b768bc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"多源采集演示：坏样本去重/隔离 + 事件流幂等 + 采集报告\n\n用法:\n  python3 datahub/collect.py                 # 默认读取 datahub/raw，输出到 datahub/output\n  python3 datahub/collect.py --raw datahub/raw --out datahub/output\n\n产出:\n  stdout                       JSON 摘要\n  <out>/quarantine.jsonl       被隔离的坏样本（含原因）\n  <out>/collection_log.jsonl   逐条处理日志\n  <out>/collection_report.md   一页采集报告\n\n口径:\n  - WMS 库存流水业务去重键 = transaction_id（对应原始 flow_id）；重复记录忽略、不得重复记账\n  - 事件流按 event_id 识别重复；\"开始/完成\"事件不能因业务键相同就忽略\n  - 未来实际事件（晚于固定快照 2026-09-18 08:00）不得进入干净表\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sqlite3\nimport sys\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta\n\nSNAPSHOT = datetime(2026, 9, 18, 8, 0, 0, tzinfo=timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\n\ndef load_jsonl(path):\n    rows = []\n    if os.path.isfile(path):\n        with open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            for line in f:\n                line = line.strip()\n                if line:\n                    rows.append(json.loads(line))\n    return rows\n\n\ndef read_set(db, sql):\n    con = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{db}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n    try:\n        return {r[0] for r in con.execute(sql)}\n    finally:\n        con.close()\n\n\ndef find_db(explicit=None):\n    cands = [explicit] if explicit else []\n    cands += [\"datahub/agent_data.sqlite\", \"agent_data.sqlite\",\n              \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/agent_data.sqlite\"]\n    for c in cands:\n        if c and os.path.isfile(c):\n            return c\n    return None\n\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--raw\", default=\"datahub/raw\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--db\", default=None)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--out\", default=\"datahub/output\")\n    a = ap.parse_args()\n    db = find_db(a.db)\n    if not db:\n        print(\"ERROR: agent_data.sqlite not found\", file=sys.stderr)\n        sys.exit(1)\n    os.makedirs(a.out, exist_ok=True)\n\n    known_tx = read_set(db, \"select transaction_id from wms_transactions\")\n    known_so = read_set(db, \"select sales_order_id from orders\")\n    known_sku = read_set(db, \"select product_id from products\")\n    unit_map = {}\n    con = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{db}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n    for pid, u in con.execute(\"select product_id, unit from products\"):\n        unit_map[pid] = u\n    for mid, u in con.execute(\"select material_id, unit from materials\"):\n        unit_map[mid] = u\n    con.close()\n\n    # ---------- 1) 坏样本：去重 + 隔离 ----------\n    cases = load_jsonl(os.path.join(a.raw, \"ingestion_bad_cases.jsonl\"))\n    ignored, quarantined, accepted = [], [], []\n    logs = []\n    for c in cases:\n        src = c.get(\"source\", \"?\")\n        